    {"type": "text", "id": "policy_body", "x": 118, "y": 660, "text": "OpenRouter provides one OpenAI-compatible API for 300-400+ models. Default fast path uses openai/gpt-4o-mini for query rewriting, HyDE and CRAG. Per-bot override can route answer synthesis to Claude, Gemini or DeepSeek. Embedding models feed Qdrant, so model choice is a quality-latency-cost tradeoff, not a single best model.", "fontSize": 16, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e"},
